			</table><br/>
			<div class='notes-par'><span style='font-weight:bold;'>荳谺｡縲蝠上＞蜷医ｏ縺帛螳ｹ</span>
			</div>
			<table style='margin-top:1em; border-collapse:collapse; width:800px; table-layout:fixed;' width='800' border='1' cellspacing='0' cellpadding='0' data-hidewhen='!(@Contains(@UserRoles;&quot;[HELP]&quot;) | @Contains(@UserRoles;&quot;[莠梧ｬ｡]&quot;) | @Contains(@UserRoles;&quot;[髢｢騾｣]&quot;) | @Contains(@UserRoles;&quot;[謳ｺ蟶ｯ莉望&quot;))'>
				<tr>
